data: {"id": "60251b16685c448e-thinking-parallel_evidence-811", "run_id": "60251b16685c448e", "node": "parallel_evidence", "node_name": "parallel_evidence", "thinking_type": "ai_message", "tool_name": null, "content": "# 2. 分析结论\n\n## 已采集事实\n\n1.  **Pod 真实状态**：\n    *   Kubernetes 显示 Pod 处于 `Pending` 阶段，但容器状态为 `Waiting`，原因 `ContainerCreating`。这与初始判断一致，且 Prometheus 指标 `kube_pod_container_status_waiting_reason{reason=\"ContainerCreating\"}` 也验证了这一点（`kube_pod_status_phase` 中 `Pending=1`, `Running=0`）。\n    *   Pod 被调度到 `node2`，但未启动成功。\n\n2.  **根因证据 (Events & Pod Spec)**：\n    *   **Events** 中反复出现 `Warning FailedMount` 事件，明确报错原文：`MountVolume.SetUp failed for volume \"input\" : configmap \"unavailable-config\" not found`。\n    *  ", "status": null, "result_preview": null, "duration_seconds": null, "iteration": 2, "ts_ms": 1788770229672, "lane_stage": "evidence"}

